WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.271
With Intlayer, each
component has a content file,

2
00:00:04.271 --> 00:00:07.010
and every string
lists every language.

3
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.881
It types those files and can
fill a missing locale with your

4
00:00:10.881 --> 00:00:11.937
AI provider.

5
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.191
General Translation keeps one
language in your code and generates

6
00:00:16.191 --> 00:00:16.840
the rest.

7
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.950
Your team writes copy once,

8
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.363
in English, inside a T component.

9
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.970
Then npx gt translate writes
every target locale before the

10
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.433
build.

11
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.100
Reviewers edit in the Dashboard,

12
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.223
and Locadex handles updates
as the code changes.

13
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.412
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
